{'symbol': 'CF', 'date': '2022-08-01 16:30:00', 'title': 'CF INDUSTRIES HOLDINGS, INC. REPORTS FIRST HALF 2022 NET EARNINGS OF $2.05 BILLION, ADJUSTED EBITDA OF $3.60 BILLION', 'text': "DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CF INDUSTRIES HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE: CF), A LEADING GLOBAL MANUFACTURER OF HYDROGEN AND NITROGEN PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED RESULTS FOR THE FIRST HALF AND SECOND QUARTER ENDED JUNE 30, 2022. HIGHLIGHTS FIRST HALF NET EARNINGS OF $2.05 BILLION(1), OR $9.78 PER DILUTED SHARE AND EBITDA(2) OF $3.47 BILLION, WHICH INCLUDE THE IMPACT OF PRE-TAX RESTRUCTURING CHARGES OF $162 MILLION RELATED TO THE COMPANY'S UK OPERATIONS; ADJUSTED EBITDA(2) OF $3.60 BILLION SECOND QUAR"}